This licence is based on PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, reproduced below
with modifications, plus one additional term stated first. Where the additional
term and the PolyForm text differ, the additional term controls.

Modifications from the canonical PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, stated so
this document does not misdescribe itself. There are two, and they are the only
two; every other section below is the canonical wording unaltered.

1. Three sections are removed: the Distribution License, the Changes and
   New Works License, and the Notices section, because the additional term
   below withdraws exactly those permissions. The permission to distribute
   verbatim unmodified copies is granted by the additional term instead.

2. The Copyright License section carries an added carve-out. The canonical
   section ends "for any permitted purpose."; this one continues ", other than
   distributing the software or making changes or new works based on the
   software." That clause is not in the canonical text and is stated here so
   the removal in point 1 is not silently reintroduced by the grant above it.

This is therefore a MODIFIED PolyForm text, not the canonical one; read the
canonical licence at the URL below if you need to compare.

This licence covers the ENTIRE repository, including the Ariadne module.

